<title>HONG KONG: HK Dec provisional trade deficit HK$14.7 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Dec provisional trade deficit HK$14.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$14.7 billion in December (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			    Dec '96	Nov '96	 Dec '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	  -14.7	  -12.64	  -12.38</p>
<p> Domestic Exports	18.2	   18.01	   20.16</p>
<p> Re-exports		98.4	  100.40	   95.15</p>
<p> Total exports	  116.7	  118.41	  115.31</p>
<p> Imports		  131.4	  131.05	  127.69</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year-ended -</p>
<p>			    Dec '96	Nov '96	 Dec '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	 -137.66	 -135.29	  -146.99</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     212.16	  214.10	   231.66</p>
<p> Re-exports	   1,185.76	1,182.47	 1,112.47</p>
<p> Total exports	1,397.92	1,396.57	 1,344.13</p>
<p> Imports		1,535.58	1,531.86	 1,491.12</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
